# --- MethdAI fork additions ---
# Self-signed TLS keypairs are generated per station by setup_station.sh. Never commit a
# private key; *.pem above already covers these, listed explicitly for clarity.
teleop/televuer/key.pem
teleop/televuer/cert.pem
teleop/teleimager/key.pem
teleop/teleimager/cert.pem

# Recorded episodes: large, and per-operator. `episode_0*` above catches most; this covers
